Subject: [PATCH 1361/3799] soh: rename func_80AFBE8C -> EnSiofuki_PushPlayer

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: while the player is inside the geyser's footprint and below its top it lifts them and adds a push in their facing direction, splashing instead when they stand on top, and hands the accumulated speed over as real velocity once they leave.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Siofuki/z_en_siofuki.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
